sequenceDiagram
 participant ST as Strategy
 participant R as Risk/Policy
 participant S as Simulator
 participant G as Guard
 participant X as Executor
 participant A as Adapter
 participant Q as Reconciliation
 ST->>R: proposal hash
 R->>S: allowed scoped action
 S->>G: simulation evidence
 G->>X: exact signer/execution intent
 X->>A: bounded submission
 A-->>Q: external evidence
 Q-->>X: reconciled/unknown
